AB  - This document presents the statement by Mozambique's Permanent Representative to the United Nations Office in Geneva during the February 10, 2020 consultations on protecting civilians in urban warfare. Mozambique expresses appreciation to Ireland for convening the consultations and for incorporating previous submissions into the draft political declaration. The statement highlights the importance of International Humanitarian Law and suggests additions to the preamble, operative section (including caring for displaced civilians, data collection, psychological support for victims, and prevention of explosive weapons diversion), and follow-up mechanism of the declaration.
