TY  - WEB
AB  - This document is a statement by Germany's Permanent Representative to the Conference on Disarmament, Ambassador Peter A. Beerwerth, delivered at the Geneva Consultations on November 18, 2019. The statement addresses the protection of civilians from the effects of explosive weapons in urban contexts. Germany supports a political declaration focused on improving civilian protection through strict compliance with International Humanitarian Law (IHL), advocating for the sharing of military good practices and enhanced data collection. The statement references German working papers and endorses the US paper on strengthening civilian protection during military operations.
